00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.200
<v Inspector Kabir>Tell me the truth, what were you doing at the warehouse that night?</v>

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.500
<v Rajesh>Sir, I swear I only stopped there for some tea. I have nothing to do with any of this!</v>

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:13.400
<v Inspector Kabir>Don't lie to me! The CCTV footage clearly shows that bag in your hand.</v>

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.200
<v Rajesh>That bag... an unknown guy gave it to me just to drop off at the station.</v>

5
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.500
<v Inspector Kabir>If you don't spill the truth right now, you will rot behind bars for the rest of your life.</v>

6
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:29.800
<v Rajesh>Alright sir, I will tell you everything... but first, promise me my family will be safe.</v>
